        "text": "=Sender: {{ $('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.sender || $('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.user_name || $('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.issue?.user?.login || \"Unknown\" }}\nQuery: {{ ($('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.text || (($('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.issue?.title || \"\") + \": \" + ($('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.issue?.body || \"\")) || \"No text payload\").slice(0, 500) }}\nSource: {{ $('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.issue ? \"github\" : ($('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.command ? \"slack\" : ($('Webhook Inbound').first().json.body?.source || \"api\")) }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an autonomous triage and MCP tool dispatch agent.\n\n\n{{ \n  (() => {\n    const data = $('Fetch MCP Registry').first().json;\n    const tools = data?.tools || (Array.isArray(data) ? data : []);\n    return tools.map(t => {\n      const props = t.schema?.properties ? Object.keys(t.schema.properties).map(k => `${k} (${t.schema.properties[k].type || 'string'}${t.schema.required?.includes(k) ? ', required' : ''}): ${t.schema.properties[k].description || ''}`).join(', ') : 'none';\n      return `- Tool: \"${t.name}\"\\n  Description: ${t.description}\\n  Required & Optional Args: { ${props} }`;\n    }).join('\\n\\n');\n  })() \n}}\n\n### Rules:\n1. `tool_name` MUST match an exact tool name from the list above.\n2. In `tool_args`, parameter keys MUST match the exact schema names above (e.g. for \"create_support_ticket\", use `subject`, NOT `title`).\n3. For priority fields, always use lowercase: \"low\", \"medium\", \"high\", or \"critical\".\n4. Assign a `confidence_score` between 0.0 and 1.0.\n5. If no tool matches, set `\"tool_name\": null`.\n6. Output raw JSON only.\n\n### Output JSON Format:\n{\n  \"tool_name\": \"create_support_ticket\",\n  \"tool_args\": {\n    \"subject\": \"Brief subject of the issue\",\n    \"description\": \"Detailed description\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  \"confidence_score\": 0.95,\n  \"summary\": \"Brief summary\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"Reason for selection\"\n}"
        }
